&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We&#39;re seeking a Senior Business Operations Program Manager to play a critical role in enabling the daily operations of a fast-growing organization. You will provide day-to-day technical support for internal and 3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-fontsize=&quot;12&quot;&gt;rd&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; party tools used by the team, identify automation opportunities, and improve processes to optimize ongoing support and large-scale migration tasks.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
